                                                "example_id": "e6297387-69e7-4d1e-b824-9703e1dd0836",
                                                "sense_id": "4ae37a94-b8e0-3955-9688-3144f5e6610a",
                                                "text": "NBC, never shy about exploiting a celebrity tragedy, overproduced and overpromoted her film in “Farrah’s Story,” but never made the public service point that, besides abstinence, the HPV vaccine is the most promising form of prevention against this type of cancer, which in most cases is sexually acquired."
